<title>USA: Interface Systems names Nero CEO.</title>
<headline>Interface Systems names Nero CEO.</headline>
<dateline>ANN ARBOR, Mich. 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Interface SystemsInc said Tuesday it appointed Robert Nero as president and chief executive officer, effective immediately.</p>
<p>Garnel Graber, chairman and acting chief executive officer, said, &quot;The directors' appointment of Bob Nero is the culmination of an extensive executive search involving several outside consultants working with the executive committee of the board.&quot;</p>
</text>
